From 3b8a539a27120118ab2ad97492c66ee724cf6b95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 06:11:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: restore Vite/Electron desktop build and apply
 non-breaking audit fixes

- Rename vite.config.js to .mjs so the ESM-only @tailwindcss/vite loads
- Install Tailwind v4 as tailwindcss-v4 for the Vite app (Next.js stays on v3)
  and keep Vite from picking up the v3 postcss.config.js
- Rename electron/main.js to .mjs and set it as package.json main
- Remove call to undefined createInlineInstructions in ImageStudio
- npm audit fix (non-breaking): 52 -> 32 advisories, next 15.5.14 -> 15.5.27

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016DqEk1rs3gP9G6SsPaXakj
